; Find Room Picture Record
;
; Used by the routine at #R$6E53.
; .
; Walks #R$B798, whose records are separated by #N($FF), until it reaches
; the current room. Rooms from #N$60 up run on into bank 0 at #R$C000.
@label=FindPictureRecord
c$6E43 LD IX,$B798   ;
