; Vocabulary Lead-In
;
; The matcher at the top of bank 3 starts one byte after this, on
; #R$A720.
@label=VocabularyLead
b$A71F DEFB $54

; Vocabulary
;
; Four-letter words and their token ids. A short word is padded with
; spaces. Id 0 is ignored, ids below #N$55 are verbs, #N$80 is IT or THEM, and
; #N$FF ends the table. Directions, GET, DROP, WEAR and QUIT are the first
; entries.
;
; .
;
; There are #N$DA words, then the terminator at #R$AB62.
@label=Vocabulary
